# 统一换行符：仓库内一律 LF。
# Windows 上 core.autocrlf=true 会让 git 在检出时把文件转成 CRLF，再改回来时就会报
# "LF will be replaced by CRLF"，而且跨平台 diff 全是整文件变化。这里显式指定 eol=lf，
# 优先级高于 core.autocrlf，Windows / macOS / Linux 检出结果一致。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制：不要做任何换行转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.so binary
*.jar binary
*.apk binary
*.aab binary
*.zip binary
*.jks binary
*.keystore binary
*.sqlite binary
*.db binary
